  'termsPolicy.sections.indemnification.p2': 'This indemnification obligation survives termination of your account and these Terms.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.disclaimer.title': 'Disclaimer of Warranties',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disclaimer.p1': 'THE SERVICES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS, IMPLIED, OR STATUTORY, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND NON-INFRINGEMENT.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disclaimer.p2': 'We do not warrant that our Services will result in Google Play approval or production access. Google Play\'s review decisions are made solely by Google and are outside our control.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disclaimer.p3': 'We do not warrant that the Services will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.termination.title': 'Termination',
  'termsPolicy.sections.termination.p1': 'We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your account and access to the Services at our sole discretion, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users or our business.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.termination.p2': 'You may terminate your account at any time by contacting us at contact@fasttesters.com.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.termination.p3': 'Upon termination, your right to use the Services will immediately cease. Provisions of these Terms that by their nature should survive termination shall remain in effect.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.termination.p4': 'We are not liable for any damages or losses resulting from account termination.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.disputeResolution.title': 'Dispute Resolution',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disputeResolution.p1': 'Before initiating any formal dispute, you agree to contact us at contact@fasttesters.com and attempt to resolve the matter through good-faith negotiation for at least 30 days.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disputeResolution.p2': 'If negotiation fails, any dispute arising from these Terms or the Services shall be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with applicable arbitration rules, except where prohibited by law.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.disputeResolution.p3': 'You agree to bring any claim individually and not as part of a class action. Nothing in this section prevents either party from seeking injunctive relief in a court of competent jurisdiction.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.governingLaw.title': 'Governing Law',
  'termsPolicy.sections.legalRestrictions.title': 'Legal Restrictions & Disclosures',
  'termsPolicy.sections.legalRestrictions.p1': 'Our Services are available worldwide to Android app developers aged 16 and older. You must comply with all applicable laws in your jurisdiction, including Google Play Developer Program policies and export control regulations.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.legalRestrictions.p2': 'We do not provide services for apps containing illegal content, malware, gambling where prohibited, adult content without proper age gates, or apps that violate intellectual property rights. We reserve the right to refuse or discontinue service for any app that violates applicable law or platform policies.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.legalRestrictions.p3': 'All prices are displayed in US Dollars (USD). Sales tax or VAT may apply depending on your location and will be shown at checkout where required by law.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.legalRestrictions.p4': 'Payments are processed by Stripe, Inc. By completing a purchase, you also agree to Stripe\'s applicable terms of service and privacy policy available at stripe.com/legal.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.governingLaw.p1': 'These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Wyoming, United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.governingLaw.p2': 'Any disputes not subject to arbitration shall be submitted to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts located in Sheridan County, Wyoming, United States.',

  'termsPolicy.sections.generalProvisions.title': 'General Provisions',
  'termsPolicy.sections.generalProvisions.p1': 'Severability: If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable, the remaining provisions will continue in full force and effect.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.generalProvisions.p2': 'Entire Agreement: These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy, Refund Policy, and Cancellation Policy, constitute the entire agreement between you and {entity} regarding the Services.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.generalProvisions.p3': 'Waiver: Our failure to enforce any right or provision of these Terms shall not constitute a waiver of that right or provision.',
  'termsPolicy.sections.generalProvisions.p4': 'Assignment: You may not assign your rights under these Terms without our prior written consent. We may assign our rights without restriction.',

  'termsPolicy.contact.title': 'Contact',
  'termsPolicy.contact.description': 'If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, contact our customer service team:',

